{"strongs": "H6772", "word": "צָמָא", "translit": "tsa.ma", "root": "צלע", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "thirst", "definition": "צָמָא noun [masculine] thirst ; — absolute ׳ צ Exod 17:3 +, suffix צְמָאִי Ps 69:22 , etc.; — Exod 17:3 ( E ), Judg 15:18 ; Hos 2:5 ; Amos 8:13 ; Lam 4:4 ; Neh 9:20 ; Ps 69:22 || רָעָב Isa 5:13 ( van d. H. צָמָה ), Deut 28:48 ; Neh 9:15 ; 2Chr 32:11 of wild asses Ps 104:11 , of fish ׳ וְתָמֹת בַּצּ Isa 50:2 , but read perhaps (or בַּצְּמֵאָה ) וּבְהֶמְתָּם בַּצָּמֵא Gunk Schöpf. 98 Che Hpt Marti (compare Isa 44:3 below following); figurative of grief of exile Isa 41:17 , compare אֶרֶץ צִיָּה וְצָמָא Ezek 19:13 with ל , thirst for water Amos 8:11 . — ׳ בַּצּ Jer 48:18 is probably corrupt; read perhaps לָאָרֶץ ( Gie ), or בֶּעָפָר .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7103')\">BDB7103</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6772')\">H6772</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7102')\">BDB7102</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7104')\">BDB7104</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>צָמָא</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>thirst</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,3)\">Exod 17:3</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>צְמָאִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 69:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,22)\">Ps 69:22</ref>, etc.; — <ref ref=\"Exod 17:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,3)\">Exod 17:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 15:18\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,18)\">Judg 15:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 2:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,5)\">Hos 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 8:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"