=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,13)\">Ezek 19:13</ref> with <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb>, <highlight>thirst for</highlight> water <ref ref=\"Amos 8:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,11)\">Amos 8:11</ref>. — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּצּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 48:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,18)\">Jer 48:18</ref> is probably corrupt; read perhaps <bdbheb>לָאָרֶץ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup>), or <bdbheb>בֶּעָפָר</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 17:3", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 69:22", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 69, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Judg 15:18", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 15, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Hos 2:5", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 2, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Amos 8:13", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Lam 4:4", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 4, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Neh 9:20", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Isa 5:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Deut 28:48", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 28, "verse": 48}, {"raw": "Neh 9:15", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "2Chr 32:11", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 32, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 104:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 104, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 50:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 50, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Isa 44:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 44, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 41:17", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 41, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ezek 19:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 19, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Amos 8:11", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 48:18", "book": "JER", "chapter": 48, "verse": 18}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["צָמָא", "׳", "צ", "צְמָאִי", "רָעָב", "צָמָה", "וְתָמֹת בַּצּ", "בַּצְּמֵאָה", "וּבְהֶמְתָּם בַּצָּמֵא", "אֶרֶץ צִיָּה וְצָמָא", "ל", "בַּצּ", "לָאָרֶץ", "בֶּעָפָר"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "